{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:10 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:10 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:10 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"警方經調查後帶走一名男子返署調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/0fe5417d9c3b1c84487199140eedd698/2026-10/page_162.jpg\"/><p>中環國際金融中心二期一間銀行，今（21日）中午12時53分，職員報案指一名男子手持7張面額1000元的紙幣，到櫃位表示要開戶口，懷疑是偽鈔。警員接報到場，經調查後拘捕該名7旬內地男子，他涉行使偽製紙幣 ，被帶返警署繼續調查。</p><img alt=\"警方經調查後帶走一名男子返署調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/be76063eea568d29f2b6613706269208/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_14_11_37.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/97ae82f7fd91db90475d46bb581bfe68/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_14_11_36.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/93d71a08f4fc6de283e6311e25e5c84b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_14_11_35_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為中環國際金融中心二期一間銀行。楊偉亨攝 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bd258f071fe7b60dd21ca2b1efc71231/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_56_53.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aaf1ecd83f5f09ad1377bb2f14a4f796/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_56_52_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fb08d900ac8f3ae7666ee7d4e4e4443c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_56_51_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/db679a02880245dfac75afefc2124a34/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_56_50_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9067cc003b399b804b9f1ddac53cb160/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_13_56_50_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T08:39:42.724179+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T06:10:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T09:57:57.583442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:37:50.274912+00:00